  "message": "Here’s a quick rundown of the finance‑analysis crew I help coordinate:\n\n| Agent / Role | What they do | Typical focus |\n|--------------|--------------|----------------|\n| **mapper_cash** | Scans the expense database for vendor patterns paid **in cash** (method = “CASH”). | Finds cash‑purchase merchants, flags recurring cash spend, builds the cash‑monthly‑totals report. |\n| **mapper_card** | Looks for transactions made with **card swipes** (method = “CARD”). | Generates the card‑monthly‑totals, highlights new card merchants and any odd spikes. |\n| **mapper_bank** | Handles ACH, online‑transfer and other **bank‑based payments** (method = “BANK”). | Produces the bank‑monthly‑totals and spots recurring bills that come directly from the bank. |\n| **mapper_other** | Catches everything else – paper checks, misc or uncategorized items (method = “OTHER”). | Supplies the “other‑monthly‑totals” and helps catch stray or mis‑tagged expenses. |\n| **synthesizer** | Merges the four mapper reports and flags missed bills, amount anomalies, and new recurring candidates. | Outputs the synthesis_report.html and a summary of anything that looks off. |\n| **receipt_scanner** | Scans uploaded receipt images, matches them to expense rows, and finds orphaned or mislabeled receipts. | Generates the orphaned‑receipts report and keeps receipt‑expense linkage clean. |\n| **expense_reconciler** | Finds expense rows without a matching receipt (excluding known receipt‑less transactions). | Produces the unaccounted‑expenses_report.md. |\n| **progress_check** | Read‑only status tool that tells you which reports already exist, their timestamps, and whether anything is stale. | Gives a quick health‑check without running any heavy analysis. |\n\nThose are the “people” (actually specialized agents) that make up the finance analysis team. Let me know if you’d like more detail on any of them or want to run a specific report!",
